{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Basic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.equivariance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.equivariance","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JointGaloisBraidAction.lean#L54-L54","doc":"**The conjecture** (cross-axis equivariance, from the manuscript):\nthe two actions commute, $g_{\\mathrm{mot}}(\\beta \\cdot \\alpha) =\n\\beta \\cdot g_{\\mathrm{mot}}(\\alpha)$ — equivalently the joint\n$G_{\\mathrm{mot}} \\rtimes S_n$ action stabilises each stratum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.braidAct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.braidAct","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JointGaloisBraidAction.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The braid-group action on the bi-filtration, through the real\nsymmetric group $S_n = $ `Equiv.Perm (Fin n)` (the braid image\npermuting Wedderburn cells). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.galAct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.galAct","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JointGaloisBraidAction.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The motivic-Galois action on the bi-filtration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.GMot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.GMot","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JointGaloisBraidAction.lean#L43-L43","doc":"The motivic Galois group $G_{\\mathrm{mot}}$ (acts on the depth\naxis; no Mathlib/QOU infra — abstract, Tier 3). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.BiFiltration","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.BiFiltration","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JointGaloisBraidAction.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The knot-indexed bi-filtration $\\mathcal{H}_q^{(n, K)}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JointGaloisBraidAction.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JointGaloisBraidAction","kind":"class","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JointGaloisBraidAction.lean#L32-L55","doc":"**Joint motivic-Galois $\\times$ braid-group action** on the\nbi-filtration $\\mathcal{H}_q^{(n, K)}$, with the braid axis carried by\nthe real symmetric group `Equiv.Perm (Fin n)`.\n\nConjectural class — see\n[`conj:joint-galois-braid-action`](../../../quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/joint-galois-braid-action.md). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:joint-galois-braid-action","label":"conj:joint-galois-braid-action","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-